# Keep the on-site content CMS in the production build:
#   app/admin/content        (the live editor page)
#   app/api/admin/content/*  (its Clerk-gated save/upload routes)
#
# Exclude ONLY the local-dev-only admin panel and its write routes
# (DCDL / Godforge / Void Hunters), which are guarded by notProd() and
# are meant to run on localhost only. Do NOT ignore `app/admin` or
# `app/api/admin` wholesale — that also removes the content CMS and makes
# /admin/content 404 in production.
app/admin/dcdl
app/api/admin/dcdl
app/api/admin/gf
app/api/admin/vh
